OL,5,G1800 Get It On with Bryan Burnett
OL,6,     FIt's all about your first foreign
OL,7,     Fholiday and the songs you recall.
OL,8,     FWith mum and dad to a Spanish
OL,9,     Fcosta, pals off to a Greek island,
OL,10,     For maybe a long bus trip with the
OL,11,     Fschool.
OL,12,G2000 Travelling Folk
OL,13,     FIn the height of the summer
OL,14,     Ffestival season. Anna shares live
OL,15,     Fconcert sets from the Orkney Folk
OL,16,     FFestival as well as a round-up of
OL,17,     Ffestivals still to come across
OL,18,     FScotland.
OL,19,G2200 Up Late
OL,20,     FThe best company to end the day,
OL,21,     Fwith lively chat and some of your
OL,22,     Ffavourite tunes.
